rsz: the four repair policies together (0069 + 0070 + 0071 + 0072)

The combined arm of the repair-knobs campaign, as one patch because the
four touch adjacent lines and their alone-diffs do not stack. Content is
exactly the four commits applied in order. Not upstreamed; the upstream
shape is one pull request per knob.

